  $$E_{\text{cycle}}(t) = \sum_{i \in \text{toggled}(t)} \frac{1}{2} C_{\text{eff},i} V_{dd}^2 \cdot |\Delta S_i(t)|$$
  $$D_{\text{active}}(t) = \max_{i \in \text{toggled}(t)} \left( \text{FO4\_Depth}(i) \right)$$

### 3. Sub-Threshold Ultra-Low-Voltage ($0.12\text{V}$) & Cryo-CMOS Physics Engine
